||t.NoBuk          :_________________________                        ||
||t.User	   :_____________                                    ||
||t.Tgl            :_______________                                  ||
||t.Disposisi      :____                                             ||
||t.Ket            :________________________________________________ ||
|\-------------------------------------------------------------------/|
